### Describe the solution you'd like
Is it not possible to check the current _actually configured/accepted_ power limit per inverter like the following (=exactly as the LiveView homepage is doing), and send a new power limit _only if really needed_?:

```
// Check if current inverter power limit is (still) valid. 
